_{1},{b}_{2}\\}$ be a basis of ${R}^{2}$ and let $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ be a linear transformation. Find $[T(x)]_{B}$, given that\n$\\,$ $[T]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "The image of $[x]_{B}$ relative to the basis $B$ under the action of the linear transformation $T$ is given by \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[T(x)]_{B} & =[T]_{B}[x]_{B} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-16 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326725 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124540 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "823a7d28-5a92-5901-8ee0-e5116df6766b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Image of a Vector Given the Matrix of a Linear Transformation Relative to a Basis"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "599638fe-e3f5-5032-bcd9-5e38ff434df2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324716} {:answer/id #uuid "5c8c5132-0247-532b-82f8-d1c35e84e006" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ -15\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324741} {:answer/id #uuid "5e626344-4849-53d2-89ed-44127837a74d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324756} {:answer/id #uuid "c7eed510-5c26-552d-8faa-ae1d4def6c32" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325705} {:answer/id #uuid "f8e7297f-94f0-54b1-9633-d7cfea9f0980" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{a